SUMMARY:Modeh Ani: Morning Prayer
DESCRIPTION:מוֹדֶה אֲנִי לְפָנֶיךָ מֶלֶךְ חַי 
 וְקַיָּם\, שֶׁהֶחֱזַרְתָּ בִּי נִשְׁמָ
 תִי בְּחֶמְלָה. רַבָּה אֱמוּנָתֶךָ\nModeh an
 i lefanecha\, Melech chai vekayam\, shehechezarta bi nishmati bechemla. Ra
 ba emunatecha.\nI thank You\, living and eternal King\, for returning my s
 oul to me with compassion. Great is Your faithfulness.\n\nSaid on waking\,
  before getting out of bed. Women say "Modah" instead of "Modeh".\n\nPleas
 e keep your streak going. You're doing awesome!\nOpen Aleph: https://alef-
 review.onrender.com/#/morning
